    "intro_narrative": "You stand in the center of the abandoned Cyber-Forensics Bureau, the air thick with dust and the low hum of dormant servers. You are here to uncover the identity of the 'Digital Ghost', a hacker who vanished leaving behind only a trail of encrypted breadcrumbs. The room is filled with disconnected terminals, locked safes, and strange processing units. Detective Reynolds speaks through your earpiece: 'The Ghost hid his confession in a fragmented data stream. You need to reactivate the system, link the correct processors, and decrypt the final file. Watch the data flow carefully, detective.'",
    "narrative_style": "detective"
